{"id":"2c598a7d73fbab7e","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-provable.md","title":"Provability in a proof system (legacy)","display":"df-provable — Provability in a proof system (legacy)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-provable","aliases":["27-df-provable"],"display":"df-provable — Provability in a proof system (legacy)","depends_on":["[[27-df-formula]]","[[27-df-sentence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-provable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-provable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provable — Provability in a proof system (legacy)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" href=\"?note=1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" title=\"27-df-formula\">27-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b0b19b94b9984da\" href=\"?note=3b0b19b94b9984da\" title=\"27-df-sentence\">27-df-sentence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" href=\"?note=1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" title=\"27-df-formula\">27-df-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3b0b19b94b9984da\" href=\"?note=3b0b19b94b9984da\" title=\"27-df-sentence\">27-df-sentence</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal P=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}\\rangle\\)</span> 为给定公式证明系统，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rules}\\subseteq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^{(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^k}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rules}\\subseteq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^{(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^k}\\)</span>。规则按原稿保留为有限元总函数，允许零元规则；不把它们与矢列规则关系混同。</li>\n<li>引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi\">\\(T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi\\)</span>。有限证明的行数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 必须至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>，行号范围固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1,\\ldots,m\">\\(1,\\ldots,m\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists(\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_m)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^m\\;\\left[\\varphi_m=\\varphi\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\;\\left(\\varphi_i\\in T\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}\\lor\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathrm{Rules}\\cap(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^{(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^k}\\;\\exists(j_1,\\ldots,j_k)\\in\\{1,\\ldots,i-1\\}^k\\;\\left[r(\\varphi_{j_1},\\ldots,\\varphi_{j_k})=\\varphi_i\\right]\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists(\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_m)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^m\\;\\left[\\varphi_m=\\varphi\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\;\\left(\\varphi_i\\in T\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}\\lor\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathrm{Rules}\\cap(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^{(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^k}\\;\\exists(j_1,\\ldots,j_k)\\in\\{1,\\ldots,i-1\\}^k\\;\\left[r(\\varphi_{j_1},\\ldots,\\varphi_{j_k})=\\varphi_i\\right]\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件是目录遗留的一阶逻辑背景（legacy background），不是《Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications》的书内对应原子。本次保留其概念接口并修复类型、绑定和依赖；未取得该书的对应定义或页码，不声称依据原书核验。</li>\n<li>修正旧稿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=0\">\\(m=0\\)</span> 却访问 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_m\">\\(\\varphi_m\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\leq m\">\\(i\\leq m\\)</span> 未排除行号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>、证明行无类型和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ar}(r)\">\\(\\mathrm{ar}(r)\\)</span> 无规则元数来源的问题。现在直接存在量化有限元数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>，不误用符号的 arity 函数。</li>\n<li>已读取 57-df-proof-system/57-df-rule 的真实函数型规则接口；这里只内建本定义用到的参数类型。旧源额外讨论公理编码可枚举性，本文件不据此宣称给定 P 可有效识别、可靠或完备。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"1f9e71c9f1e5764e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"3b0b19b94b9984da","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"1f9e71c9f1e5764e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S$、$\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ 见 [[27-df-formula]]、[[27-df-sentence]]；$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$，$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"3b0b19